Recruiting Operations,

Confirmed for Requisition Alpha: People Analytics Partner, three planned
openings, with a role-level planning range of JPY 7.2-8.4M. Please proceed
with the published structured-interview plan for candidate IDs A01-A05.

Panel aliases and evidence areas
- Panel-Insights: analytical framing and measurement choices
- Panel-Partners: stakeholder alignment and operating judgment
- Panel-Systems: workflow design and data stewardship

Use the same prompts, timeboxes, and scorecard rubric for each candidate.
Record job-related evidence only; do not add personal background, compensation
history, or comparative commentary. Any score variance greater than one point
should be flagged for calibration before the debrief.

Next steps: Recruiting Operations sends the availability grid; People
Operations confirms the scorecard completeness check. See the follow-up in
<p15-ralpha-availability-20260818-1120@orchidpeople.example>.

Hiring Manager
Orchid People

--p15-alpha-manager-20260818
